                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="37" width="350" height="65.5"/>
                                                                                <string key="text">In order for the prosthesis to open or close, the signal from the sensor must cross a threshold. But, this will only happen if the signals from the sensors do not cross their thresholds at the same time as each other.</string>
