                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="49" width="350" height="65.5"/>
                                                                                <string key="text">Normal sensitive mode reduces false signals but is slower to respond to muscle tension, while "increased sensitive" mode responds faster to muscle signals with less noise immunity.</string>
