                                                                        <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="2254.5" width="350" height="461.5"/>
                                                                        <subviews>
                                                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" text="Application version and size" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="3" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="eiL-uV-tQo">
                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="350" height="33.5"/>
                                                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Inter-Regular_SemiBold" family="Inter" pointSize="18"/>
                                                                                <color key="textColor" white="0.0" alpha="1" colorSpace="custom" customColorSpace="genericGamma22GrayColorSpace"/>
                                                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                                            </label>
                                                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" verticalCompressionResistancePriority="749" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="WDZ-0G-x9k">
                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="49.5" width="350" height="196"/>
                                                                                <string key="text">The last line in the advanced settings shows the version of the application. And the selected size of the prosthesis. The size of the prosthesis affects the limitation of the maximum current, so it should be chosen consciously. Otherwise there is a risk of setting a cut-off current that will damage the prosthesis. (the maximum cut-off current of the XL size prosthesis will kill the S size prosthesis (the cut-off simply doesn't work because less powerful motors are used, so they get hot and fail), but if you tell the S size prosthesis that it is an S size, the maximum cut-off current will match that size and not allow the prosthesis to break)</string>
                                                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="OpenSans-Regular" family="Open Sans" pointSize="14"/>
                                                                                <color key="textColor" name="deselected_text_filter"/>
                                                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                                                            </label>
