                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="566.5" width="350" height="57.5"/>
                                                                                <string key="text">6. Presence of traces of damage to the product by the user and/or third parties (chips, dents, falling from a height of more than 1 m on a hard surface, etc.).</string>
                                                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="OpenSans-Regular" family="Open Sans" pointSize="14"/>
