                                                                                <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="400.5" width="350" height="57.5"/>
                                                                                <string key="text">8. Immersion in water and washing the prostheses under water jets is prohibited. The prostheses is IP 54, which means it can be used in the rain.</string>
